    <comment pinned="false" w="390" h="170">Read one complete newline-terminated command. Partial lines stay in a fixed byte buffer. CR is ignored; oversized commands are discarded. There is no String allocation or waiting for bytes. Expand this reusable function to see the ordinary array and logic blocks.</comment>
